      <title>NVIDIA App 11.0.9 更新：游戏内统计浮层新增 CPU 温度功耗监控</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260910/NVIDIA-App-11.0.9-%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E5%86%85%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%A1%E6%B5%AE%E5%B1%82%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E-CPU-%E6%B8%A9%E5%BA%A6%E5%8A%9F%E8%80%97%E7%9B%91%E6%8E%A7/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
